         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">In recent years high-frequency brain activity in the gamma-frequency band (30‚Äì80 Hz) and above has become the focus of a growing body of work in MEG/EEG research.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">High-frequency brain activity and muscle artifacts in MEG/EEG: a review and recommendations</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
